    "description": "As Ops, I want a link I add to a live deal to reach the CMS without re-publishing by hand, so a rep is never assigned a link the CMS has never seen.\n\n* Record-triggered flow on Deal_Link\\__c fires on insert, and on update of Link_Codec, URLc or Active_\\_c, calling the SAME invocable Apex as the Deal-triggered path — no duplicate code path\n\n* Passes the parent Deal Id; payload is the standard FULL DEAL SNAPSHOT per §4.3. No second payload shape\n\n* Suppressed where the parent deal has never synced, or where Sync_Ready__c is false\n\n* TEN LINKS INSERTED IN ONE TRANSACTION PRODUCE EXACTLY ONE PUSH — verified by test\n\n* Sync status, note and timestamps update exactly as for a Deal-triggered push (BUILD-83)\n\nEffort: 3-5h. Blocked by BUILD-63 and BUILD-66.\n\nSource: CMS Integration Design v1, §4.1 + Appendix A.",
